    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"be the ending\"... that's a heavy way to put it. you're saying that it's okay that there's nothing left? that maybe there isn't supposed to be a next chapter? it's just... so hard to keep pretending that there's more coming when the truth is that everything that mattered is already gone.",
